#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:16 a9e21d158efe4d00885d7f8654218cbf
msgid "A simple gain/volume effect for amplifying or attenuating audio signals."
msgstr "简单增益效果，用于放大或衰减信号。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:21 233627c3bba248daaf2dda96a109f59f
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:23 51f6da25431b469296f9d37d6fbe354e
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectAmplify is a basic gain control effect that increases or decreases the volume of "
"the audio signal. It provides both decibel (dB) and linear control over the amplification level."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectAmplify**    会在总线效果链中创建一个增益 DSP。它适合做总线音量微调、临时放大或衰减，也可以在运行时用    ``volume_db``    "
"或    ``volume_linear``    做平滑的强度控制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:25 d04bdbd8c88d44fe9fdebdeae596481e
msgid ""
"Use this effect for simple volume adjustments, boosting quiet signals, or attenuating loud "
"signals in your audio pipeline."
msgstr "用于调整音量、放大较弱的信号或衰减过强的信号。"

