#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:94 dd9feeac8bd340718d5fcb383aacc537
msgid ""
"The amplification level as a linear value. It is converted to "
":ref:`volume_db<class_FmodAudioEffectAmplify_property_volume_db>` and clamped to that "
"property's -80 to +24 dB range, corresponding to approximately 0.0001 to 15.8489. A value of "
"1.0 is unity gain; setting 0.0 produces the minimum gain rather than silence."
msgstr ""
"线性增益值。该值会转换为  :ref:`volume_db<class_FmodAudioEffectAmplify_property_volume_db>` ，并限制在 -80 到 "
"+24 dB，对应的线性范围约为 0.0001 到 15.8489。1.0 为单位增益；设置 0.0 会得到最小增益，而非静音。"
